{
  "name": "Pinterest WF2 - Publish via Metricool",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Pinterest – Workflow 2: Publish approved pins (daily)\n\nReads **both** the **Pinterest Pins** tab (blog-sourced) and the **Pinterest2:3 Pins** tab (product-photo-sourced), takes rows where **Approval = Approved** and **Status = Review**, resolves the **Board name -> Board ID** (from the Tailwind Boards tab — board IDs are native to Pinterest, so they still work unchanged), normalizes each pin's image via Metricool, and schedules each pin in **Metricool** at its **Scheduled Date**. Writes back Status / Pin URL / Error / Pinned Time to whichever tab that row came from (tracked internally as `_sourceTab`).\n\n**Setup:** Google Sheets + Metricool (Header Auth, X-Mc-Auth) credentials. Set userId, blogId, pinsTab, and pinsTab2 in Set Config.",
        "height": 492,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "7a900912-0725-4f73-a944-fe626a3c90db",
      "name": "README",
